       "code": "public static int What(int k, int[] A, int s, int e)\n{\n    if (s == e)\n        if (A[s] > k)\n            return A[s];\n        else\n            return 0;\n    else\n    {\n        int p1 = What(k, A, s, (s + e) / 2);\n        int p2 = What(k, A, ((s + e) / 2)+1, e);\n        return p1 + p2;\n    }\n}",
